---
import ConsentCard from '../product/ConsentCard.astro';
import AuditTrail from '../product/AuditTrail.astro';
---

<section class="bg-wash py-14 lg:py-[6rem]">
  <div class="container-page">
    <p class="text-button font-semibold tracking-wide text-brand-green uppercase">On the record</p>
    <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-[52rem] text-display font-semibold">
      The patient says yes <span class="text-brand">before anything is recorded.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-[52rem] text-lead font-medium text-ink-soft/80">
      CARE-E gives you a plain script to read, records the patient’s answer with a timestamp, and
      keeps a log of every action in the visit. Your compliance team can export it any time.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:mt-14 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-10">
      <ConsentCard />
      <AuditTrail />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
